","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"立山 秋航","creatorId":"vndb:s19027","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s19027","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s19027","name":"立山 秋航","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:102229","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c21425","characterName":"川奈 ヒナ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c21425"},"originalCharacterName":"川奈 ヒナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An ordinary high schooler who previously attended an ordinary school. Due to her father's job, Hina was made to transfer to the prestigious St. Christopher Academy. She's a kind and hardworking girl; doing her best to wrap her head around the various (and strict) rules of St. Christopher."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Like most students of St. Christopher, she greatly admires her competent, kind and handsome teachers. However, after she inadvertently breaks the school rules, she gets a glimpse of their true natures. Her interactions with the teachers she had once admired will greatly change her life..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21425"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/96/96c42bf6f239c4d3f469b839242db10c6cdfc50133717a61e943e10bc4bf4ce1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/07/0744716779b50b663b1395f87956dcea925241657348289775988acea5489fdf.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c21426","characterName":"志奴 要","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c21426"},"originalCharacterName":"志奴 要","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"424"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"184"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"66"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Graduating at the top of his class from a super famous school in America, he is an excellent English teacher who possesses a prodigious wit. He's very popular amongst his students. Because his father is a diplomat, he's well-versed in a number of languages. At a glance he might seem like a good-natured teacher, but in truth, he loathes people who are stupid. He'll spontaneously confront the people he doesn't like, thoroughly persecuting them and finds pleasure in forcing them to surrender. His demeanor changes completely if his glasses are taken off."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Otome Jikan."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21426"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/dbaff003022bb24bae0cad4fb91881e523d8a02e100f3e5fc6b0734016511f02.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8b1d9bc3d0bd315e8673b1486167062fb85f87d413f4b6a96c621cdcc3b2608c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高橋 広樹","creatorId":"vndb:s67","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s67","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s67","name":"高橋 広樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:54656","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c21427","characterName":"凪原 大貴","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c21427"},"originalCharacterName":"凪原 大貴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"179"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"63"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A ruthless Math teacher who has a genius mathematician for a father. Although at a glance he might seem calm and cool-headed, in truth, he has a paranoid personality. Moreover, because he's fastidious and completely has no interest in people's emotions, he's thoroughly ruthless towards any person he deems worthless. When he's lost in his thought while he's instructing, he has a habit of fiddling with his lighter. He despises smug people who has others fawning over them like Shido."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Otome Jikan."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21427"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dcba8dd1cb71e0868f6db7debac84ab9c33f1bbc71d6faa4ff8049ad3620885d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/14/1471233a1a4373503ee0fb901817356b1a7f1effefc5c9d0260f8bfbc9eec700.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"寺島 拓篤","creatorId":"vndb:s63","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s63","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s63","name":"寺島 拓篤","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:54655","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c21428","characterName":"葛葉 翔","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c21428"},"originalCharacterName":"葛葉 翔","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"811"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"180"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"68"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Generally speaking, he's a world history teacher who's flashy in both appearance and behavior. Most likely because he grew up without a mother, he hold some prejudice towards women and believes that all high school girls are just playing around. He enjoys playing around, mocking idiotic students through excessive skinship. Although he has a wealth of historical knowledge, he only thinks of it as a \"tool\" to make a living. He doesn't see a lot of value in people, but he somehow gets along with Kashu."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Otome Jikan."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21428"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dc2a1fa30ae295f15274013c45742bbe90020c46a7ece3f0c1e72f1dc6fc210d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5e/5e6f0f5af140c192fb40c3618d1cede9c89198851e9be1beddf5b98f9ef6dc97.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高橋 直純","creatorId":"vndb:s69","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s69","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s69","name":"高橋 直純","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:54657","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c21429","characterName":"加修 レム","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c21429"},"originalCharacterName":"加修 レム","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"518"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"171"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mad scientist-like chemistry teacher who likes exciting experiments. With no interest in this transient world, he's more the type to float around in his environment but he's very much pleased with this academy because it's abundant in experimental material. He hates tedium and will immediately drop anything that's boring. Conversely, if you satisfy him, his feelings will run so high you can't limit him anymore. He likes sweet things and eats sugar cubes when he's tired. It seems that Kuzuha will occasionally bring him food."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Otome Jikan."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21429"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ab/abfeeb79929041355ac9a2f67751aa71adf37e67892a1b18552a3d0ab6d6f076.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5/f59536872177469b1f24909f3affa5b9f1b1bc027086abe14a002640f15ef0eb.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柿原 徹也","creatorId":"vndb:s80","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s80","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s80","name":"柿原 徹也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:54658","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c21430","characterName":"柳 遼太","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c21430"},"originalCharacterName":"柳 遼太","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"185"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"73"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The popular teacher in charge of civics, with a refreshing outward appearance. He teaches about ethics and modern society but he doesn't believe that they have any value whatsoever, so he finds it funny that he's teaching those subjects. Having a violent temperament in contrast with his appearance, it seems these destructive impulses have led him to furiously damage property behind the scenes. When his hair is brushed back, he changes so much that he looks like another person. It seems that he and Tojo are childhood friends."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Otome Jikan."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21430"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7e/7e192074076753c377ef4f7d95f1dc225060769244123d10f0a4891bef6c58e1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c984ffd99fe8e1cf62b9cd3014b6391a24a5039d7d94d2fcd03dae6839d4c832.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"伊藤 健太郎","creatorId":"vndb:s89","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s89","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s89","name":"伊藤健太郎","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:54660","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c21431","characterName":"東條 海里","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c21431"},"originalCharacterName":"東條 海里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"107"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","